WEBVTT

00:10:28.081 --> 00:10:31.502
moj stol pa je prilepil na pod.

00:10:31.502 --> 00:10:35.131
(Smeh) (Aplavz)

00:10:37.003 --> 00:10:39.059
Ena od zabavnih stvari, 
ki sem se jih naučila

00:10:39.059 --> 00:10:40.720
ob delu s Keithom Olbermannom,

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:44.734
je, da so ljudje na internetu barabe.

00:10:44.734 --> 00:10:46.962
Pravijo, da so otroci kruti,

00:10:46.962 --> 00:10:50.290
ampak iz mene se nikoli niso norčevali,
ne kot otroka ne kot odrasle.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:53.985
Naenkrat je moja invalidnost 
na spletu postala poštena igra.

00:10:53.985 --> 00:10:55.996
Spletni videi so imeli

00:10:55.996 --> 00:10:57.606
take komentarje:

00:10:57.606 --> 00:11:00.197
"Hej, zakaj se zvija?"